{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-2901","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3148","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3149","text":": Spatial Intelligence for Agents"}]},{"id":"blk-2902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3150","text":"The "},{"id":"spn-3151","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3152","text":" capability family represents an agent's ability to reason about "},{"id":"spn-3153","marks":["bold"],"text":"where things are, how they move, how regions relate to one another, and what actions are valid in a spatial context"},{"id":"spn-3154","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-2903","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3155","text":"In the [&] Protocol, "},{"id":"spn-3156","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3157","text":" is one of the four core cognitive primitives (alongside "},{"id":"spn-3158","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-3159","text":" the sensorimotor primitive and "},{"id":"spn-3160","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-3161","text":" the cross-cutting operational primitive):"}]},{"id":"blk-2904","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3162","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-3163","text":" — what the agent knows"}]}],"id":"blk-2905","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2908","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3164","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-3165","text":" — how the agent decides"}]}],"id":"blk-2907","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3166","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-3167","text":" — when things happen"}]}],"id":"blk-2909","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3168","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3169","text":" — where things are"}]}],"id":"blk-2911","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3170","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-3171","text":" — how the agent is instantiated in an environment (perception, action, affordance)"}]}],"id":"blk-2913","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3172","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-3173","text":" — who is acting, under what rules, at what cost"}]}],"id":"blk-2915","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2917","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3174","text":"Spatial capability matters whenever an agent operates over fleets, maps, routes, regions, geofences, topologies, facilities, service territories, supply chains, or any system where location and position change what a valid decision looks like."}]},{"id":"blk-2918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3175","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3176","text":" is distinct from "},{"id":"spn-3177","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-3178","text":": "},{"id":"spn-3179","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3180","text":" models external spatial data (fleet positions, regions, routes), while "},{"id":"spn-3181","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-3182","text":" models the agent's own sensorimotor interface to an environment (perception, typed action, affordance enumeration). An agent may consume "},{"id":"spn-3183","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-3184","text":" to reason about where vehicles are AND declare "},{"id":"spn-3185","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.motor"},{"id":"spn-3186","text":" to actuate one."}]},{"id":"blk-2919","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3187","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-2920","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3188","text":"Why "},{"id":"spn-3189","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3190","text":" exists as a first-class primitive"}]},{"id":"blk-2921","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3191","text":"A large number of agents fail in subtle ways because they treat the world as if it were only text plus tools."}]},{"id":"blk-2922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3192","text":"That is often enough for toy demos, but it breaks down quickly in real systems."}]},{"id":"blk-2923","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3193","text":"A support agent may need to know which warehouse serves a customer. A fleet agent may need to know which vehicles are inside a region. An infrastructure agent may need to know which datacenter cluster is affected by an incident. A delivery agent may need to know whether a route crosses a restricted area. A security or compliance agent may need to know whether data or assets entered a prohibited zone."}]},{"id":"blk-2924","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3194","text":"Those are not just \"tool calls.\" They are spatial questions."}]},{"id":"blk-2925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3195","text":"Treating spatial intelligence as a first-class capability allows the protocol to express:"}]},{"id":"blk-2926","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2928","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3196","text":"that an agent has spatial awareness at all"}]}],"id":"blk-2927","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3197","text":"what kind of spatial awareness it has"}]}],"id":"blk-2929","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2932","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3198","text":"which provider implements it"}]}],"id":"blk-2931","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3199","text":"how it composes with memory, time, and reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-2933","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2936","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3200","text":"what types it accepts and produces in a pipeline"}]}],"id":"blk-2935","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2937","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3201","text":"Without "},{"id":"spn-3202","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3203","text":", spatial reasoning tends to be hidden inside ad hoc prompt logic or application-specific glue code. The result is architecture that looks plausible but is difficult to validate, govern, or reuse."}]},{"id":"blk-2938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3204","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-2939","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3205","text":"What "},{"id":"spn-3206","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3207","text":" means in the protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-2940","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3208","text":"At the protocol level, "},{"id":"spn-3209","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3210","text":" is not a vendor, map service, or database."}]},{"id":"blk-2941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3211","text":"It is a "},{"id":"spn-3212","marks":["bold"],"text":"capability interface"},{"id":"spn-3213","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-2942","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3214","text":"That means:"}]},{"id":"blk-2943","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2945","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3215","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-3216","text":" is a protocol capability"}]}],"id":"blk-2944","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2947","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3217","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic"},{"id":"spn-3218","text":" is one provider that may satisfy it"}]}],"id":"blk-2946","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2949","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3219","text":"another provider could also satisfy "},{"id":"spn-3220","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-3221","text":" if it implements the same contract"}]}],"id":"blk-2948","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3222","text":"This separation is important."}]},{"id":"blk-2951","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3223","text":"If spatial intelligence were modeled only as provider names, then architecture would collapse into product branding. By modeling "},{"id":"spn-3224","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3225","text":" as an interface family, the protocol stays portable."}]},{"id":"blk-2952","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3226","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-2953","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3227","text":"Common "},{"id":"spn-3228","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3229","text":" subtypes"}]},{"id":"blk-2954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3230","text":"The current protocol direction suggests several useful subtype patterns."}]},{"id":"blk-2955","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3231","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]},{"id":"blk-2956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3232","text":"Represents awareness of distributed assets, vehicles, units, nodes, or regions as a coordinated fleet-like system."}]},{"id":"blk-2957","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3233","text":"Typical concerns:"}]},{"id":"blk-2958","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2960","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3234","text":"region occupancy"}]}],"id":"blk-2959","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2962","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3235","text":"asset distribution"}]}],"id":"blk-2961","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2964","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3236","text":"nearest available unit"}]}],"id":"blk-2963","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2966","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3237","text":"affected-region lookup"}]}],"id":"blk-2965","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2968","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3238","text":"current fleet state"}]}],"id":"blk-2967","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2970","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3239","text":"capacity by territory"}]}],"id":"blk-2969","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2971","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3240","text":"This is the subtype most relevant to logistics, dispatch, field operations, and infrastructure regions."}]},{"id":"blk-2972","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3241","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.route"}]},{"id":"blk-2973","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3242","text":"Represents route computation, path constraints, spatial transitions, and route optimization."}]},{"id":"blk-2974","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3243","text":"Typical concerns:"}]},{"id":"blk-2975","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2977","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3244","text":"shortest or cheapest path"}]}],"id":"blk-2976","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2979","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3245","text":"route feasibility"}]}],"id":"blk-2978","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2981","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3246","text":"route recomputation"}]}],"id":"blk-2980","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2983","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3247","text":"path explanation"}]}],"id":"blk-2982","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2985","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3248","text":"route impact under changing conditions"}]}],"id":"blk-2984","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2986","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3249","text":"This subtype matters when sequence through space is more important than current static position."}]},{"id":"blk-2987","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3250","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.geofence"}]},{"id":"blk-2988","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3251","text":"Represents boundary-aware spatial logic."}]},{"id":"blk-2989","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3252","text":"Typical concerns:"}]},{"id":"blk-2990","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2992","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3253","text":"enter/exit events"}]}],"id":"blk-2991","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2994","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3254","text":"restricted zones"}]}],"id":"blk-2993","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2996","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3255","text":"compliance zones"}]}],"id":"blk-2995","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2998","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3256","text":"operating boundaries"}]}],"id":"blk-2997","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3000","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3257","text":"service areas"}]}],"id":"blk-2999","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3002","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3258","text":"event-triggered actions based on region membership"}]}],"id":"blk-3001","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3003","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3259","text":"This subtype is useful whenever boundary conditions affect policy or action."}]},{"id":"blk-3004","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3260","text":"Future subtype candidates"}]},{"id":"blk-3005","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3261","text":"As the protocol evolves, additional spatial subtypes may emerge, for example:"}]},{"id":"blk-3006","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3008","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3262","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.topology"}]}],"id":"blk-3007","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3010","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3263","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.facility"}]}],"id":"blk-3009","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3264","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.coverage"}]}],"id":"blk-3011","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3265","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.territory"}]}],"id":"blk-3013","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3015","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3266","text":"The protocol should stay conservative at the primitive level and extensible at the subtype level."}]},{"id":"blk-3016","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3267","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3017","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3268","text":"What problems "},{"id":"spn-3269","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3270","text":" solves"}]},{"id":"blk-3018","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3271","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3272","text":" gives the protocol a standard place to express capabilities like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3019","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3021","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3273","text":"finding where an event occurred"}]}],"id":"blk-3020","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3274","text":"mapping impact to regions or zones"}]}],"id":"blk-3022","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3025","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3275","text":"connecting a decision to real-world or logical geography"}]}],"id":"blk-3024","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3027","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3276","text":"constraining actions by allowed locations"}]}],"id":"blk-3026","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3029","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3277","text":"ranking options by distance, route cost, or region state"}]}],"id":"blk-3028","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3031","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3278","text":"enriching a decision with local spatial context"}]}],"id":"blk-3030","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3279","text":"These are especially important when spatial context changes the meaning of the same underlying event."}]},{"id":"blk-3033","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3280","text":"Example:"}]},{"id":"blk-3034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3281","text":"An anomaly in CPU usage means something very different if it affects:"}]},{"id":"blk-3035","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3037","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3282","text":"one isolated test node"}]}],"id":"blk-3036","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3283","text":"every production node in "},{"id":"spn-3284","marks":["code"],"text":"us-east"}]}],"id":"blk-3038","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3041","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3285","text":"a route-optimization cluster near a major logistics hub"}]}],"id":"blk-3040","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3043","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3286","text":"a restricted compliance boundary"}]}],"id":"blk-3042","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3287","text":"The anomaly itself may be temporal. The business meaning often becomes spatial."}]},{"id":"blk-3045","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3288","text":"That is why "},{"id":"spn-3289","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3290","text":" composes naturally with "},{"id":"spn-3291","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-3292","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-3046","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3293","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3047","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3294","text":"Cognitive role of "},{"id":"spn-3295","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-3048","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3296","text":"A useful way to think about the four primitives is:"}]},{"id":"blk-3049","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3051","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3297","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-3298","text":" stores and recalls prior structure"}]}],"id":"blk-3050","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3053","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3299","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-3300","text":" evaluates and decides"}]}],"id":"blk-3052","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3055","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3301","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-3302","text":" models change and sequence"}]}],"id":"blk-3054","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3057","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3303","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3304","text":" localizes state and action"}]}],"id":"blk-3056","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3058","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3305","text":"In practice, "},{"id":"spn-3306","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3307","text":" helps answer:"}]},{"id":"blk-3059","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3061","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3308","text":"Where is this happening?"}]}],"id":"blk-3060","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3063","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3309","text":"What else is nearby or inside the same boundary?"}]}],"id":"blk-3062","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3065","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3310","text":"What region, route, zone, or topology is affected?"}]}],"id":"blk-3064","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3067","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3311","text":"What actions are allowed in this location?"}]}],"id":"blk-3066","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3069","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3312","text":"How does location change priority or response?"}]}],"id":"blk-3068","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3070","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3313","text":"This makes "},{"id":"spn-3314","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3315","text":" an essential primitive for situated agents."}]},{"id":"blk-3071","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3316","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3072","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3317","text":"Typical providers"}]},{"id":"blk-3073","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3318","text":"The protocol does not require one provider, but a few provider patterns are common."}]},{"id":"blk-3074","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3319","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic"}]},{"id":"blk-3075","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3320","text":"A natural example provider for "},{"id":"spn-3321","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-3322","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-3076","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3323","text":"This kind of provider may expose:"}]},{"id":"blk-3077","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3079","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3324","text":"region state"}]}],"id":"blk-3078","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3081","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3325","text":"fleet distribution"}]}],"id":"blk-3080","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3083","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3326","text":"geofencing"}]}],"id":"blk-3082","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3085","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3327","text":"location enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-3084","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3087","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3328","text":"affected-region queries"}]}],"id":"blk-3086","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3088","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3329","text":"GIS and geospatial databases"}]},{"id":"blk-3089","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3330","text":"A geospatial database or service can satisfy parts of "},{"id":"spn-3331","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3332","text":" if it exposes the right contract."}]},{"id":"blk-3090","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3333","text":"Examples might include systems built around:"}]},{"id":"blk-3091","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3093","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3334","text":"PostGIS"}]}],"id":"blk-3092","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3095","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3335","text":"custom geospatial indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-3094","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3097","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3336","text":"spatial event stores"}]}],"id":"blk-3096","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3099","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3337","text":"topology services"}]}],"id":"blk-3098","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3100","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3338","text":"Routing engines"}]},{"id":"blk-3101","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3339","text":"A routing engine may satisfy parts of "},{"id":"spn-3340","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.route"},{"id":"spn-3341","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-3102","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3342","text":"What matters is not the brand name, but whether the implementation satisfies the protocol contract for that subtype."}]},{"id":"blk-3103","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3343","text":"Custom domain-specific spatial systems"}]},{"id":"blk-3104","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3344","text":"A warehouse graph, datacenter topology model, maritime route service, or airspace constraint system could all act as "},{"id":"spn-3345","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3346","text":" providers if they are wrapped behind the expected capability surface."}]},{"id":"blk-3105","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3347","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3106","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3348","text":"Example declaration"}]},{"id":"blk-3107","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3349","text":"A simple spatial capability declaration in "},{"id":"spn-3350","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-3351","text":" might look like this:"}]},{"id":"blk-3108","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3352","text":"{ \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"FleetManager\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&space.fleet\": { \"provider\": \"geofleetic\", \"config\": { \"regions\": [\"us-east\", \"us-central\"], \"mode\": \"regional-capacity-awareness\" } } }, \"provenance\": true }"}]},{"id":"blk-3109","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3353","text":"A goal-driven variant might use auto-resolution:"}]},{"id":"blk-3110","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3354","text":"{ \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"RouteCoordinator\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&space.route\": { \"provider\": \"auto\", \"need\": \"regional route optimization with compliance boundaries\" } }, \"governance\": { \"infer_from_goal\": true }, \"provenance\": true }"}]},{"id":"blk-3111","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3355","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3112","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3356","text":"Example contract shape"}]},{"id":"blk-3113","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3357","text":"A capability contract for "},{"id":"spn-3358","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-3359","text":" might express operations like these:"}]},{"id":"blk-3114","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3360","text":"{ \"capability\": \"&space.fleet\", \"operations\": { \"locate\": { \"in\": \"asset_query\", \"out\": \"location_set\" }, \"enrich\": { \"in\": \"context\", \"out\": \"spatial_context\" }, \"capacity\": { \"in\": \"region_query\", \"out\": \"capacity_snapshot\" } }, \"accepts_from\": [\"&time.*\", \"&memory.*\", \"raw_data\"], \"feeds_into\": [\"&reason.*\", \"&memory.*\", \"output\"], \"a2a_skills\": [\"fleet-state-enrichment\", \"regional-capacity-lookup\"] }"}]},{"id":"blk-3115","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3361","text":"The point is not that every provider must use exactly these names."}]},{"id":"blk-3116","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3362","text":"The point is that spatial capability should expose:"}]},{"id":"blk-3117","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3119","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3363","text":"explicit operations"}]}],"id":"blk-3118","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3121","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3364","text":"explicit input/output types"}]}],"id":"blk-3120","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3365","text":"explicit compatibility boundaries"}]}],"id":"blk-3122","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3124","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3366","text":"That is what makes composition validateable."}]},{"id":"blk-3125","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3367","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3126","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3368","text":"Example pipelines involving "},{"id":"spn-3369","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-3127","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3370","text":"Temporal event localized spatially"}]},{"id":"blk-3128","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3371","text":"A common flow is:"}]},{"id":"blk-3129","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3372","text":"stream_data"}]},{"id":"blk-3130","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3373","text":"Interpretation:"}]},{"id":"blk-3131","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3374","text":"1. detect anomalies 2. map those anomalies to affected regions or assets 3. reason over the enriched operational context"}]},{"id":"blk-3132","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3375","text":"Memory + spatial context"}]},{"id":"blk-3133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3376","text":"Another common pattern is:"}]},{"id":"blk-3134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3377","text":"incident_context"}]},{"id":"blk-3135","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3378","text":"Interpretation:"}]},{"id":"blk-3136","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3379","text":"1. retrieve similar prior incidents 2. determine whether current assets or actions intersect constrained zones 3. reason under both historical and spatial constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-3137","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3380","text":"Route-aware planning"}]},{"id":"blk-3138","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3381","text":"A route-sensitive planning flow may look like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3139","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3382","text":"delivery_request"}]},{"id":"blk-3140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3383","text":"Interpretation:"}]},{"id":"blk-3141","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3384","text":"1. produce route options or route context 2. enrich with temporal expectation such as demand or congestion window 3. select or evaluate a plan"}]},{"id":"blk-3142","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3385","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3143","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3386","text":"How "},{"id":"spn-3387","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3388","text":" composes with the other primitives"}]},{"id":"blk-3144","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3389","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3390","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-3391","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"}]},{"id":"blk-3145","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3392","text":"Memory helps answer what happened before. Space helps answer where it is happening now."}]},{"id":"blk-3146","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3393","text":"Together they support questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3147","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3394","text":"Have we seen incidents like this in this region?"}]}],"id":"blk-3148","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3151","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3395","text":"Which routes historically fail under these conditions?"}]}],"id":"blk-3150","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3396","text":"Which service zones tend to exceed capacity after similar events?"}]}],"id":"blk-3152","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3397","text":"This pairing is especially strong for historical localization."}]},{"id":"blk-3155","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3398","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3399","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-3400","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"}]},{"id":"blk-3156","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3401","text":"Time detects sequence, trend, anomaly, or forecast. Space localizes the effect."}]},{"id":"blk-3157","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3402","text":"Together they support questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3158","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3160","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3403","text":"Which region is drifting toward overload?"}]}],"id":"blk-3159","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3404","text":"Where are anomalies clustering over time?"}]}],"id":"blk-3161","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3164","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3405","text":"Which route becomes invalid during a forecasted demand spike?"}]}],"id":"blk-3163","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3406","text":"This pairing is essential for operational and logistics agents."}]},{"id":"blk-3166","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3407","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3408","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-3409","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"}]},{"id":"blk-3167","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3410","text":"Spatial context often changes which decisions are acceptable."}]},{"id":"blk-3168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3411","text":"Reasoning without spatial awareness can choose actions that are technically coherent but operationally invalid."}]},{"id":"blk-3169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3412","text":"Together they support questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3170","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3413","text":"Is scaling in this region allowed under policy?"}]}],"id":"blk-3171","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3414","text":"Which region should receive rerouted capacity?"}]}],"id":"blk-3173","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3176","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3415","text":"Which route balances service level and compliance risk?"}]}],"id":"blk-3175","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3177","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3416","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3417","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-3418","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-3419","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-3420","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-3421","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-3422","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"}]},{"id":"blk-3178","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3423","text":"This is the full composition story for many real systems:"}]},{"id":"blk-3179","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3424","text":"memory gives history"}]}],"id":"blk-3180","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3425","text":"time gives dynamics"}]}],"id":"blk-3182","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3185","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3426","text":"space gives localization"}]}],"id":"blk-3184","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3187","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3427","text":"reason gives decision logic"}]}],"id":"blk-3186","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3188","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3428","text":"That combination is why the protocol models all four primitives rather than reducing everything to one generic intelligence bucket."}]},{"id":"blk-3189","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3429","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3190","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3430","text":"Governance implications of "},{"id":"spn-3431","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-3191","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3432","text":"Spatial systems often have strong governance requirements."}]},{"id":"blk-3192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3433","text":"Examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-3193","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3434","text":"never route assets through a restricted zone"}]}],"id":"blk-3194","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3435","text":"never expose private location data outside authorized context"}]}],"id":"blk-3196","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3436","text":"always escalate when operations cross a jurisdictional boundary"}]}],"id":"blk-3198","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3201","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3437","text":"prefer routes that remain inside approved service areas"}]}],"id":"blk-3200","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3438","text":"prefer region-local action over cross-region action when confidence is low"}]}],"id":"blk-3202","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3204","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3439","text":"This makes "},{"id":"spn-3440","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3441","text":" especially relevant to declarative governance."}]},{"id":"blk-3205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3442","text":"A governance block might include rules like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3206","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3443","text":"{ \"governance\": { \"hard\": [ \"Never route assets through restricted geofences\", \"Never disclose customer or fleet location outside authorized workflows\" ], \"soft\": [ \"Prefer local-region remediation before cross-region failover\" ], \"escalate_when\": { \"hard_boundary_approached\": true, \"confidence_below\": 0.75 } } }"}]},{"id":"blk-3207","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3444","text":"The protocol's value here is that spatial constraints become portable data, not hidden application logic."}]},{"id":"blk-3208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3445","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3209","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3446","text":"Provenance implications of "},{"id":"spn-3447","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-3210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3448","text":"Spatial enrichment should be provenance-aware."}]},{"id":"blk-3211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3449","text":"If an agent reasons over spatial context, a provenance chain should preserve facts like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3212","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3450","text":"which spatial capability produced the region mapping"}]}],"id":"blk-3213","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3216","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3451","text":"which provider supplied the spatial enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-3215","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3452","text":"which operation was called"}]}],"id":"blk-3217","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3453","text":"which input led to the spatial result"}]}],"id":"blk-3219","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3454","text":"what downstream reasoning consumed that result"}]}],"id":"blk-3221","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3455","text":"That is important for questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-3224","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3226","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3456","text":"Why did the agent choose "},{"id":"spn-3457","marks":["code"],"text":"us-east"},{"id":"spn-3458","text":" over "},{"id":"spn-3459","marks":["code"],"text":"us-central"},{"id":"spn-3460","text":"?"}]}],"id":"blk-3225","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3461","text":"Why did the system reject this route?"}]}],"id":"blk-3227","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3230","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3462","text":"Which geofence triggered escalation?"}]}],"id":"blk-3229","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3232","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3463","text":"Which provider determined regional capacity?"}]}],"id":"blk-3231","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3464","text":"Spatial claims can have major operational consequences, so they should be auditable."}]},{"id":"blk-3234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3465","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3235","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3466","text":"Design patterns for "},{"id":"spn-3467","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-3236","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3468","text":"Pattern 1: Spatial enrichment before reasoning"}]},{"id":"blk-3237","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3469","text":"Good when the decision depends on location-aware context."}]},{"id":"blk-3238","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3470","text":"Example: detect first, localize second, reason third."}]},{"id":"blk-3239","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3471","text":"Pattern 2: Boundary validation before execution"}]},{"id":"blk-3240","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3472","text":"Good for compliance and operational safety."}]},{"id":"blk-3241","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3473","text":"Example: check geofence or route legality before the planner or executor commits an action."}]},{"id":"blk-3242","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3474","text":"Pattern 3: Region-aware memory lookup"}]},{"id":"blk-3243","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3475","text":"Good when similarity depends on both event type and location."}]},{"id":"blk-3244","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3476","text":"Example: retrieve prior incidents from the same facility type, same region class, or same route family."}]},{"id":"blk-3245","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3477","text":"Pattern 4: Spatial fallback routing"}]},{"id":"blk-3246","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3478","text":"Good when a preferred route or region becomes invalid."}]},{"id":"blk-3247","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3479","text":"Example: route planner requests an alternative region or path under governance constraints."}]},{"id":"blk-3248","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3480","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3249","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3481","text":"Anti-patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-3250","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3482","text":"Anti-pattern 1: Treating space as just metadata"}]},{"id":"blk-3251","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3483","text":"If location meaningfully changes action, "},{"id":"spn-3484","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3485","text":" should be modeled explicitly, not buried in arbitrary JSON fields."}]},{"id":"blk-3252","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3486","text":"Anti-pattern 2: Collapsing all spatial problems into one provider call"}]},{"id":"blk-3253","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3487","text":"Route planning, geofencing, and fleet-state enrichment are related but not identical. Subtypes exist to keep those concerns distinct."}]},{"id":"blk-3254","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3488","text":"Anti-pattern 3: Letting reasoners infer geography from raw text alone"}]},{"id":"blk-3255","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3489","text":"A reasoner may be excellent at explanation and still be a poor source of authoritative spatial state."}]},{"id":"blk-3256","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3490","text":"Anti-pattern 4: Ignoring provenance for location-sensitive decisions"}]},{"id":"blk-3257","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3491","text":"Spatial decisions without lineage are hard to debug and risky to audit."}]},{"id":"blk-3258","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3492","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3259","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3493","text":"How "},{"id":"spn-3494","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3495","text":" should evolve"}]},{"id":"blk-3260","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3496","text":"The protocol should keep "},{"id":"spn-3497","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3498","text":" simple at the primitive level and expressive at the subtype and contract level."}]},{"id":"blk-3261","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3499","text":"That suggests a few healthy directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-3262","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3264","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3500","text":"preserve "},{"id":"spn-3501","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3502","text":" as a stable top-level primitive"}]}],"id":"blk-3263","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3266","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3503","text":"allow subtypes to evolve as use cases become clearer"}]}],"id":"blk-3265","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3268","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3504","text":"keep providers separate from capabilities"}]}],"id":"blk-3267","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3270","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3505","text":"encourage typed contracts instead of loose \"map\" outputs"}]}],"id":"blk-3269","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3272","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3506","text":"expand examples and registry entries only when grounded in real use cases"}]}],"id":"blk-3271","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3273","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3507","text":"A good "},{"id":"spn-3508","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3509","text":" ecosystem is not one with the most subtype names. It is one where spatial capability is explicit, composable, and trustworthy."}]},{"id":"blk-3274","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3510","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3275","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3511","text":"Practical examples in this repository"}]},{"id":"blk-3276","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3512","text":"The protocol repository already points toward several spatially relevant examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-3277","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3279","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3513","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-3514","text":" in infrastructure and fleet-oriented declarations"}]}],"id":"blk-3278","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3281","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3515","text":"provider patterns such as "},{"id":"spn-3516","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic"}]}],"id":"blk-3280","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3283","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3517","text":"composition with "},{"id":"spn-3518","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-3519","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-3520","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-3282","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3284","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3521","text":"As the docs hub expands, useful next additions would include:"}]},{"id":"blk-3285","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3287","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3522","text":"a route-planning example declaration"}]}],"id":"blk-3286","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3289","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3523","text":"a geofence/compliance example"}]}],"id":"blk-3288","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3291","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3524","text":"a contract artifact for "},{"id":"spn-3525","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]}],"id":"blk-3290","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3293","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3526","text":"registry entries for additional spatial providers"}]}],"id":"blk-3292","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3295","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3527","text":"diagrams showing "},{"id":"spn-3528","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3529","text":" composition with time and reason"}]}],"id":"blk-3294","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3530","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-3297","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-3531","text":"Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-3298","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3532","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3533","text":" is the protocol's answer to the question:"}]},{"id":"blk-3299","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3534","marks":["bold"],"text":"How does an agent represent and reason about where things are?"}]},{"id":"blk-3300","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3535","text":"It matters because many real agent systems are not purely textual or purely symbolic. They are situated."}]},{"id":"blk-3301","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3536","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3537","text":" makes spatial intelligence:"}]},{"id":"blk-3302","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3304","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3538","text":"explicit in the declaration"}]}],"id":"blk-3303","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3306","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3539","text":"separable from providers"}]}],"id":"blk-3305","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3308","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3540","text":"contract-aware"}]}],"id":"blk-3307","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3310","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3541","text":"composable with memory, time, and reason"}]}],"id":"blk-3309","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3312","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3542","text":"governable"}]}],"id":"blk-3311","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3543","text":"provenance-aware"}]}],"id":"blk-3313","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-3316","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3544","text":"compilable into downstream agent artifacts"}]}],"id":"blk-3315","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-3317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3545","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-3546","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-3547","text":" helps the agent remember, and "},{"id":"spn-3548","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-3549","text":" helps it decide, and "},{"id":"spn-3550","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-3551","text":" helps it understand change,"}]},{"id":"blk-3318","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-3552","text":"then "},{"id":"spn-3553","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-3554","text":" helps it stay grounded in the world the decision actually affects."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieralr6hybrfbf7lhth5fbawfvutjps6rd4vv76jkx47k3ankmuze5za","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}